# The leakage follows the profile that emits a Gaussian matched to the fibre, up to what the etch can provide.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Gaussian-apodised grating, leakage limited to 0.4 per um
grating angle=10 length=30
leak 0.4
apodise gaussian
expect radiated 0.98908705 1e-06
expect overlap 0.98892624 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.48906707 2e-05
expect position 15.04993563 0.005
expect efficiency_db -3.10632 0.0005
